q('nga_senior_r2_2018_9','Number Theory','Sequences & recurrences|Squares & powers',r'The Fibonacci numbers satisfy $F_1=F_2=1$ and $F_{n+2}=F_{n+1}+F_n$. Prove that $F_{2n-1}$ is a sum of two integer squares for every $n\ge1$.')
